1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,882
As theta grows, e to the i theta walks round the unit circle.

2
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:08,268
At theta equal to pi it reaches minus one.

3
00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:18,203
So e to the i pi plus one equals zero: Euler's identity, linking e, i, pi, one and zero in a single line.

